{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25872","headline":"山出云 · 李绅","name":"山出云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳霭祥云起，飘扬翠岭新。\n萦峰开石秀，吐叶间松春。\n林静翻空少，山明度岭频。\n回崖时掩鹤，幽涧或随人。\n姑射朝凝雪，阳台晚伴神。\n悠悠九霄上，应坐玉京宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}